    feat(weather_markets): blend far-tail climatology into rain forecast signal beyond the 16-day horizon
    
    Extends the shadow-only rain_forecast_blend_prob signal (backlog.txt L2911,
    formerly L2838) to tickets checked early in their accrual month, where the
    remaining window exceeds Open-Meteo's forecast horizon -- previously the
    signal was simply skipped for that case. Now blends a real near-forecast
    prefix (capped to a genuine 14-day window, recovering ECMWF's real horizon
    per a live-verified opus finding) with resampled far-tail climatology via
    a deterministic cross product, tail-scoped SEAS5 tilt, and a new gap guard
    against a newly-reachable circuit-breaker corruption path. Still shadow/
    log-only; blended_prob/rec_side/sizing are untouched.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

